# Terraform local state/plugins — the state file stores real values for every resource
# attribute, including ones from variables marked sensitive (e.g. db_password), so it
# must never be committed. .terraform.lock.hcl is the one exception: that's just
# provider version pinning, not sensitive, and should stay tracked.
docs/deployment/.terraform/
docs/deployment/terraform.tfstate
docs/deployment/terraform.tfstate.backup
docs/deployment/*.tfplan
docs/ec2/*.tfvars
